/*!
\page page_stbbctriggerdetector StBbcTriggerDetector

\brief BBC trigger detector data: 64 PMT ADC/TDC values, DSM registers, scalars, pedestal tables.

\section stbbctriggerdetector_overview Overview
\c StBbcTriggerDetector stores raw and processed data from the Beam-Beam Counter (BBC),
STAR's primary luminosity monitor and minimum-bias selector.  It holds ADC and TDC
values for all 64 PMTs per side, DSM register outputs, scalar rate counters, pedestal
and MIP calibration tables, and the online east–west time difference used for the
online z-vertex estimate.

\section stbbctriggerdetector_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StBbcTriggerDetector
\endcode

\section stbbctriggerdetector_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| unsigned int[64] | mAdc | ADC per PMT (0–31=east, 32–63=west) |
| unsigned int[64] | mTdc | TDC per PMT |
| unsigned int[8] | mRegisters | DSM Layer-2 register outputs |
| unsigned int[128] | mPedestalData | Pedestal, width, MIP tables |
| unsigned int[32] | mScalars | Scalar rate counters |
| unsigned short | mDSMVTX | Online east–west time difference |

\section stbbctriggerdetector_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `unsigned int adc(unsigned int pmt) const` | ADC for PMT 0–63 |
| `unsigned int tdc(unsigned int pmt) const` | TDC for PMT 0–63 |
| `unsigned int bbcRegister(int i) const` | DSM register i |
| `unsigned int scalar(int i) const` | Scalar counter i |
| `float pedestal(int id) const` | Pedestal for channel id |
| `float mip(int id) const` | MIP calibration value |
| `unsigned int adcSumEast() const` | East ADC sum |
| `unsigned int adcSumWest() const` | West ADC sum |
| `unsigned int nHitEast() const` | East hit count |
| `unsigned int nHitWest() const` | West hit count |
| `unsigned int tdcEarliestEast() const` | Earliest east TDC |
| `unsigned int tdcEarliestWest() const` | Earliest west TDC |
| `unsigned short onlineTimeDifference() const` | DSM online time difference |

\section stbbctriggerdetector_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StBbcTriggerDetector& bbc = event->triggerDetectorCollection()->bbc();
cout << "nHitEast=" << bbc.nHitEast() << "  nHitWest=" << bbc.nHitWest() << endl;
bool minbias = bbc.nHitEast() >= 1 && bbc.nHitWest() >= 1;
\endcode

\see \ref page_sttriggerdetectorcollection
\see \ref page_stzdctriggerdetector
*/
